	quest.00584464DA0226E8.quest_desc: ["Not compatible with the multiblock kitchen but still useful."]
	quest.0080ACE2ED1E81EE.quest_desc: [
		"To use your backpack, open your inventory and place the backpack into the curio slot. Curios can be accessed by pressing the top-left button or the center tab."
		""
		"Press [B] to open your backpack."
	]
	quest.0080ACE2ED1E81EE.title: "Getting Started, Backpacks"
	quest.00BAC9D4A7389882.quest_desc: [
		"It's recommended to get plenty of clay for base defense."
		""
		"And some ingots!"
	]
	quest.013385B73C5B427C.quest_desc: [
		"Your basic power generator. Put in coal and get power."
		""
		"Beyond this lies the full OriTech mod tree. Prepare yourself for peak."
	]
	quest.023C11B9F7A7B34E.quest_desc: ["Add to a pipe network and power it, and it'll boost the thoroughput."]
	quest.0254B961F1766017.quest_desc: [
		"If you have framerate issues, please press [o] to turn off or change shaders. "
		""
		"Or, lower your chunk render distance and other settings in the video settings menu. "
		""
		"This modpack loads the resource pack \"Ashen 16x\" in the profile folder -> config -> openloader -> packs. You can change whatever default resource pack you want there. Just drag and drop in the zip after deleting Ashen 16x. "
		""
		"The questbook is built around getting special Eyes of Ender. You need twelve to open the Stronghold's portal to the Ender Dragon to complete the game. These can be found or gained through quest rewards. "
		""
		"Once in the End however, the game doesn't end. There is a total-conversion End mod called Stellarity. Explore it and summon the Emperess of Light in her garden!"
	]
	quest.02CF38565BE582DD.quest_desc: ["beeeeg"]
	quest.040E6847265A63B0.quest_desc: ["pls google fr fn ty"]
	quest.0522B9DB59744A66.quest_desc: ["An end-game component that also lets you craft two unbreakable and enchantable tools."]
	quest.062686464E0FAB62.quest_desc: ["Put in Uranium Fuel Pellets. Powah! Uranite doesn't work. "]
	quest.06D64461313ECCD1.title: "Godly Artifact"
	quest.0715303A555E1BB0.quest_desc: [
		"There is an annoying bug that won't let you rejoin your own world after you launch the Minecraft client the first time. "
		"If you have to leave your world and want to rejoin, please restart your client for now. "
		"Your world is safe, it's some obscure mod's obscure error, and will be fixed when the cause is found. "
	]
	quest.0728D29879567C6E.quest_desc: ["Complete quest rewards to unlock Artifacts!"]
	quest.0728D29879567C6E.title: "Common Artifact"
	quest.07D68DF922C43B04.quest_desc: ["Yeah, pretty good. It speeds up as you wear out the durability too."]
	quest.080FD06FA417F9C8.quest_desc: [
		"This machine turns raw ore blocks into raw ores, and raw ores into raw ore dust. "
		"It will also discover trace elements within the ores and seperate them for your own use. "
		""
		"Gotta get that ore multiplying goin'."
	]
	quest.08D832ECF50CC8AB.quest_desc: ["give me your seed"]
	quest.096A53276B5255FC.quest_desc: [
		"The Stablized Enchanter lets you choose whatever enchantment you want, provided you have enough souls in nearby Arcane Cataylsts."
		""
		"If the tool is at a maximum level of enchantment, you can \"Hyper Enchant\" an item to exeed it. This may require stablizing the Arcane Cataylsts, which can be done by feeding them extra power with Enderic Lasers. "
	]
	quest.0C89C4B57F9F6D41.quest_desc: [
		"Stellarity goes here, pls google ty vm :)))"
		""
		"Have a meal as a reward!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"
	]
	quest.0D1283A167D89F9C.quest_desc: ["It glows, very cool."]
	quest.0F1613DE2D48E143.quest_desc: ["Create your first friend! Create enough bronze to build an automaton to help you brave the dangerous world around you. It can best set to follow or wait."]
	quest.1088AE06FDAC7148.quest_desc: ["It can create computer chips, lets you build the drone port, and upgrade add-ons!"]
	quest.111A9BE3DF453854.quest_desc: ["Craft to increase xp gain!"]
	quest.111A9BE3DF453854.title: "Artifact XP"
	quest.130C83B4E46D4586.quest_desc: ["Pretty sure you can stick these in a Silent Gear Salvager as well, just saying. "]
	quest.13D87789C016D7FF.quest_desc: ["With Machine Extenders, the sky's the limit!"]
	quest.140BF4C44A7DA642.title: "Rare Artifact"
	quest.149A7864D81F161F.quest_desc: [
		"Use the modpack's content to gain more gold. (Mystical Agriculture)"
		""
		"You can re-add an item stack to your inventory to re-trigger the quest event."
	]
	quest.14DD596BD923B814.quest_desc: [
		"To use a blueprint, craft the required amount of material with the blueprint item. The item won't be consumed, but the materials will."
		""
		"This is different from template boards, which are consumed in every craft. It's recommended to move to blueprints as soon as possible for this reason."
		""
		"Use this to mix and match incredible combinations!"
		""
		"Silent Gear and Silent Gems is an enormous mod. Please, check the wiki to learn all about it. "
	]
	quest.15B84D16412206DC.quest_desc: ["Yes, Sophisticated Storage will allow you to autocraft, smelt, and so on to a degree. You can upgrade chests for greater easy storage, but do know that later-game mods can potentially be an upgrade."]
	quest.17CF844B0243146D.quest_desc: ["You can pose regular armor stands. "]
	quest.18B67F55A08ADBDA.quest_desc: [
		"Kill mobs around an arcane catalyst to feed it. It powers the stablized enchanter. "
		""
		"You can also use it to enchant any item with any enchanted book. "
	]
	quest.19531E1069763C5E.quest_desc: ["Make a bunch of these."]
	quest.1A308D5C6FCFE283.title: "The World is Dangerous and you need help! (Early Mod Golem)"
	quest.1C43C87B5AFB5392.quest_desc: ["Has both silk touch and 1 x 3 area mining modes. "]
	quest.1C75C98E3847336B.quest_desc: ["Find any structure in your world with an Explorer's Compass."]
	quest.1CE322A2459327BB.quest_desc: ["Pulverizers ores. And biomass. Turns it to dust."]
	quest.1D3CBBAF8CDB8791.quest_desc: [
		"Put a waterskin inside the ice box to cool it. In warm weather, the cool waterskin will regulate your temperature."
		""
		"Fill the icebox with ice, snow, powder snow buckets, or snow blocks to maximum capacity. "
	]
	quest.1DDD924BBD4D597B.quest_desc: ["Used for rotten flesh and some other \"trash\" organic items, you can compost them into bone meal!"]
	quest.1E52D45179406063.quest_desc: ["Automatons are melee-only, but have a sizeable health pool. They're great early-game helpers and base defenders, and pretty cheap."]
	quest.1E7DEA6D40E61E8D.quest_desc: ["Both a pickaxe and a shovel."]
	quest.1F92B0717FB92A56.quest_desc: [
		"Maybe it's worth saving up?"
		"Or maybe you should just go to the Nether and bed mine for forever."
		""
		"You know, if you did some automation, this probably wouldn't be that hard to get..."
	]
	quest.1F92B0717FB92A56.title: "Netherite Seeds!!!!!"
	quest.2019BFD032EBD6B5.title: "Food Mods"
	quest.21C4FD8783CB9DC0.quest_desc: [
		"Your next task is to head to an Ender Portal and slay the Ender Dragon."
		""
		"After which, you win the game! Just like in vanilla Minecraft."
		""
		"This doesn't mean the game ends, of course. "
		"You have to kill the Empress of Light to do that."
		"What's the Empress of Light? It's a special boss in the End..."
	]
	quest.228848D11EB68EA2.quest_desc: [
		"You can decorate chests, nobody knows this or ever uses this. "
		""
		"Purple is the color of royalty. Why not that?"
	]
	quest.2299E5443C61689B.quest_desc: ["Once you've found or made some armor, you can use a sewing table to add insulation from the elements. "]
	quest.22AE1703899581F9.quest_desc: ["The perfect companion for the hellish nether. You can only have so many cooled waterskins. "]
	quest.23EF41C85134B36D.quest_desc: ["Pretty gud"]
	quest.242737028F94228A.quest_desc: [
		"There's a lot more than these three upgrades for your golems. Check EMI!"
		"These three are pretty standard standouts."
	]
	quest.2549E6A41C9EAB3B.quest_desc: ["Avalible in many different colors!"]
	quest.259B3F19809C971B.quest_desc: ["The Foundry is an optimizing machine. It'll let you craft alloys such as steel and netherite with less ingredients. "]
	quest.25CD10620D88EEE3.quest_desc: ["Put snow inside to fuel."]
	quest.26594B9376DDC20D.quest_desc: ["Doesn't actually need the Foundry, just putting it here for lulz."]
	quest.2695025B0F13E8EE.quest_desc: [
		"Cooking for Blockheads is the greatest savior mod for all food mods. "
		""
		"Create a multiblock kitchen that allows you to easily craft every single food item in the game if fully kitted out. Be sure to have a cooking table, sink, stove with cookware, toaster, cabinets, and especially the tool racks to cook the ultimate food!"
		""
		"There's also an online wiki for this mod if you have any questions. "
	]
	quest.27B9A05D487720C3.quest_desc: ["You can automate biomass production, couldn't you?"]
	quest.290267ED21097D96.quest_desc: [
		"Thank you for downloading this modpack!"
		"Farmtastic! is designed for you to farm to your heart's content, but not without reason. "
		"The world is dangerous and you need to get strong enough to take it head on."
		"Please follow the questbook to discover how!"
	]
	quest.2B4D1356CE459377.title: "- - - S H O P - - -"
	quest.2C389990CD5F6F82.quest_desc: ["Create a couple Gears (1-4) to tame your Automaton. This also doubles their health."]
	quest.2DC53B130BCAB550.quest_desc: ["It's literally just a speedy furnace. That you power with electricty!"]
	quest.2E7AE55C63A55B96.quest_desc: ["The Centrifuge is an important crafting block. It'll turn ore dust into ore clumps, coal dust into carbon fiber, and oil or wheat into plastic sheets. "]
	quest.2ECD881FB6F7DD90.quest_desc: ["Better this than the lava pit."]
	quest.2EE70D20DE2EF178.quest_desc: ["AE2 is in this modpack! The greatest storage solution ever devised, and requires power to work. So, build that underground nuclear reactor and irradiate your farm!"]
	quest.317D5BEB9005FC41.quest_desc: ["A modification tool for Sophisticated Storage. It can be used to link blocks not physically touching the storage controller, but is within range. The unconnected chest must be adjacent to a Storage Link for this to work."]
	quest.31A59163FE118948.quest_desc: [
		"If you're on the move and don't want to deal with having a big workshop, you can now carry around a whole workshop in your inventory!"
		""
		"You just need the crafting block and an item frame. Pretty simple. "
	]
	quest.31C703C4694AB00F.quest_desc: ["Convert XP to gold coins!"]
	quest.31CCDA6589B53EA9.quest_desc: ["Once you make this you're officially certified as an OriTech engineer. So, you can make all the deco blocks."]
	quest.326648BA6D082C04.quest_desc: [
		"Use an Ender Pearl to create a Bag of Yurting!"
		""
		"You can use this to take any structure, anywhere."
		""
		"Perfect for a tent as you expore!"
	]
	quest.3284E5CCD7E6DC1F.quest_desc: [
		"When you find a Tavern, on the second floor is a villager that trades maps. Use those maps to find some unique structures!"
		"Usually they require emeralds and compasses. "
	]
	quest.328F408358CAD34D.title: "Epic Artifact"
	quest.337AD541BF47B982.quest_desc: [
		"The first thing you'd want is probably a campfire. And an enclosed space or wall."
		""
		"Nights are cold!"
	]
	quest.33AB9EF0790D2DCA.quest_desc: [
		"In Farmtastic!, you have the possibility of meeting Champion mobs. "
		""
		"They sometimes have aura that you can literally see. If you do see any Champion mob, it is highly recommended to flee."
		"Again they literally have aura. "
	]
	quest.354FF1DEE233F45B.quest_desc: ["It's blast-proof!"]
	quest.35BD4CC9006AE0E3.quest_desc: [
		"A unique machine that can infinitely generate resources, if only you were to find the corresponding Ore Resource Node at the bottom of the world. "
		""
		"Bedrock Extractors mine directly below themselves in 3x3 area. You must power them with enderic lasers."
		""
		"These Ore Resource Nodes usually spawn at y -57, in a pocket of crude oil. They are marked on the surface with OriTech ore boulders."
	]
	quest.35C6C9AC5B91647B.quest_desc: ["Use the target designator to link two drone ports. Both must be chunk-loaded."]
	quest.36102E678A5AC3E0.quest_desc: [
		"Place on the top of a boiler or icebox to radiate the effect of the boiler or icebox outwards to heat or cool the surrounding area."
		""
		"It is around 60% of the effectiveness of its upgrade, the hearth."
		""
		"Smokestacks can be stacked to raise the cosmetic effect past the roof of your farmhouse."
		""
		"Please note that the area around the boiler or icebox must be enclosed. Otherwise you'd lose all the temperature to the ambient enviroment."
	]
	quest.36A1168B5E4C3DE7.quest_desc: ["Hey, this might be worth something."]
	quest.36C0901AE0012880.quest_desc: ["Same but (much) better."]
	quest.37210DCC5EB60794.quest_desc: [
		"Upon first loading in, you are given an Immersive Caves guidebook and the Eccentric Tome."
		"Please craft the two together. The Eccentric Tome allows you to keep all mod guidebooks together as one item."
		""
		"Simply right-click upwards to activate, and left-click to revert. "
	]
	quest.37210DCC5EB60794.title: "Getting Started, The Eccentric Tome"
	quest.383226FEC6739C0A.quest_desc: ["If you kill the Ender Dragon with a cleaver, you can harvest its corpse, make scales into armor, butcher it, et cetera. "]
	quest.3915E07F7DFBF231.quest_desc: ["It doesn't actually require power. You need to put in coal."]
	quest.3971ED525337CE5E.quest_desc: ["Really helps with your base defense, especially if you go and make a nuclear reactor under your farmhouse. (Very based)"]
	quest.3A6BA6F6B7E30F6B.title: "Legendary Artifact"
	quest.3A78DC2F935A81ED.quest_desc: ["This block converts Forge Energy (FE) from OriTech or Powah or AE2, into electricity usable by appliances from MrCrayfish's Furniture mod."]
	quest.3B6C62A9458D9AC2.quest_desc: [
		"An incredibly useful workhorse block, the Enderic Laser requires a large amount of electricty, but can be used to:"
		""
		"- Kill monsters or any mob of your choice as base defense"
		"- Transfer energy to another block wirelessly"
		"- Mine in a specific direction you tell it to"
		"- Be used on budding Amethyst to generate Fluxite"
	]
	quest.3B97CBB0625E3EAE.quest_desc: ["Let it capture a creature by having that creature walk on top of it. Then, build a case underneath and feed it with souls to spawn another of that creature. Do note that it won't be in the cage. The mob's blueprint is just stored there. "]
	quest.3C12258298FCC4DF.quest_desc: ["Stores all your blueprints in one spot!"]
	quest.3C2720C007236A43.quest_desc: ["It has been discovered through playtesting that getting fluxite is in fact, annoying."]
	quest.3D0A85FCB4C432A1.title: "You can upgrade the add-ons!"
	quest.3DFCC94846C9996C.quest_desc: [
		"Serene Seasons is installed and visible to your right under the minimap."
		"This will dramatically affect the temperature of your biome. It'll be hot in the summer and snow in the winter."
		""
		"The blocks around you, the height you're at, whether you're swimming or near a furnace, are all able to influence your temperature."
		""
		"In extreme cases you'll die! Don't ignore it!"
	]
	quest.3DFCC94846C9996C.title: "Getting Started, Seasons"
	quest.3E3E56064605BD16.quest_desc: [
		"Yep. Cuts trees. "
		""
		"Any tree that's *checks notes* under 8000 blocks???????"
	]
	quest.3E5558878C035C22.quest_desc: ["It's just cool."]
	quest.3EDB214AEEA694F0.quest_desc: ["Now that you have some insulation, you can find the exact biome you want to settle in."]
	quest.3FF8211EFD7DAAEE.quest_desc: ["Use the Calendar to see exactly how long the current season will last. Just hover over it."]
	quest.41B6180B9F636D5D.quest_desc: ["It's not blast proof..."]
	quest.41C52E0764E09C3E.quest_desc: [
		"Netherite is considered a coating. You can apply it by using a smithing table."
		""
		"You cannot really craft an item with it, but instead you upgrade an existing item. It is exactly like vanilla. "
	]
	quest.42853D259B358271.quest_desc: [
		"Put a waterskin into a boiler to heat it up and regulate your temperature in cold enviroments. "
		""
		"To fuel a boiler, put in any wood, coal, or lava. The same as you would into a furance. "
	]
	quest.42D90C281C814228.title: "Main Booster"
	quest.430BAB67A95354AE.title: "Sub Booster"
	quest.43C7FDAFF87F1E1E.quest_desc: ["This is found in the End. You need Netherite or an equivalent to mine it. "]
	quest.43F0C984C92CF97C.quest_desc: [
		"This book is literally just a link to the wiki. The wiki is HIGHLY RECOMMENDED. "
		""
		"Especially check the list of traits, and the sheer amount of materials and what they do."
	]
	quest.45D92949C08C1345.quest_desc: ["Buy multiple to craft to get higher tiers! Same with other two."]
	quest.45D92949C08C1345.title: "Stat Containter"
	quest.46CEF45713115DC5.quest_desc: ["Put two on a guide ring to shoot particles in opposite directions."]
	quest.46EDD85F33312F0A.quest_desc: ["Both enhances crop growth and hydrates farmland below. Used explicitly for farming."]
	quest.46F522BA8378546F.quest_desc: ["Gives you fire resistance if near!"]
	quest.4759170BF2BB7641.quest_desc: [
		"A superior smokestack that can both heat or cool an area."
		""
		"Either fuel or pack with ice and snow, and use redstone to turn the hearth on. A lever from below will turn on the heat, and a lever on the hearth will trigger the cooling."
		""
		"Both can be on simultaneously. "
	]
	quest.4826B60F8E4FF0AA.title: "OriTech"
	quest.49334176DC6DFA53.quest_desc: [
		"Occultism is in this modpack! "
		""
		"Use this guide to learn how to magic and summon (enslave) evil spirits to pick your crops. And more. "
		""
		"The corresponding Farmer's Delight mod is also installed. Please enjoy this burger. "
	]
	quest.49FBB85E8F65B12B.quest_desc: ["Barter with Piglins!"]
	quest.4AEAC7EA805698DB.quest_desc: [
		"This one is my favorite :)"
		""
		"You get upcharged you can't take him from me! ! !"
	]
	quest.4C0222499CC49DC7.quest_desc: ["See the laser with Ruby Lenses, or put glass in front of the beam. It will detect blocks in front, and the beam will change color based on the color of glass in front. "]
	quest.4D39B6F641527C8F.quest_desc: [
		"MrCrayfish's Refurbished Furniture mod is an excellent modern-themed decorative mod. It features an alternative kitchen, stove, refrigerator, televsion, light system with switches, computer, and more. "
		""
		"Handcrafted, Bibliocraft, Beautify, and Another Furniture are also present. There's so many decorative blocks to choose from that it's impossible to show them all."
		""
		"It's recommended to go @[modname] in EMI to see them all. "
		"A single item of every decorative mod is present so you can see the spelling. "
	]
	quest.4DB3C4C14ADC535F.quest_desc: [
		"The bottom five blueprints can be added after the tool is crafted, at any time."
		"The rest are listed in a recommended progression."
		"Paxels are always recommended!"
	]
	quest.4DDAEE1DFD0F21C3.quest_desc: ["S P E E D"]
	quest.4DE8D7AFB287F61C.quest_desc: [
		"You can store a single item, such as cobblestone, in this block up to a large amount. "
		"The counterpart mod Storage Drawers is also present, if that is preferable. "
	]
	quest.5076C9FC13B4FB6E.quest_desc: ["This is a good deal, consider this a discount. "]
	quest.521ED436470849BA.quest_desc: ["Rename to your heart's content!"]
	quest.53A326E44A883414.quest_desc: [
		"You can apply grades to a tool MATERIAL by crafting a Grader Catalyst and putting those materials into the Material Grader. "
		""
		"The possible grades for any part are E, D, C, B, A, S, SS, SSS, MAX. "
		"The parts will be graded as a normal distribution based on the Grader Catalyst used. "
		""
		"You should expect to craft a lot of Grader Catalysts. "
		"You can also re-roll already Graded tool materials as many times as you want. It'll still follow the normal distribution (a bell curve, think the IQ chart meme.)"
	]
	quest.53C1B4037AFFB70C.quest_desc: ["I'm going into battle, and I need your strongest potions, potion seller."]
	quest.546E724C21A6E6F4.quest_desc: ["They don't have to connect exactly. Right-click to make a 45 degree angle, and check the wiki."]
	quest.54C511D9F3F2F3EE.quest_desc: [
		"You now have a thirst bar that's exactly like your hunger bar."
		""
		"Instead of saturation you have \"quenchness,\" and you can replenish it with some juicy foods, drinking dirty water, or creating"
		"a drink such as tea."
		""
		"Water-Skins will automatically filter whatever water you pick up. The leather is anti-bacterial. Don't worry about it. "
		"To drink a Water-Skin, shift-right-click. Just right-clicking dumps the water on you to lower your temperature."
		""
		"Otherwise you can purify water in glass bottles or wooden bowls in a furnace or campfire. "
		"If you drink unpurified water from a flowing source block, you'll get less sick."
		""
		"To heal, you need to have both Quenchness and Saturation. "
	]
	quest.561A1825569D2FAF.quest_desc: ["Blaze Gold isn't the best for tools, but provides some bonuses and is needed to craft a necessary block: the Material Grader."]
	quest.56978D81C97ADFC5.quest_desc: ["This is the optimal progression, as described on the Silent Gear Wiki."]
	quest.5697921915928CB0.quest_desc: ["Occultism has a flow chart for the entire mod online on their wiki. It's highly recommended to look at either that or the guidebook."]
	quest.573CCEF850E2A4FC.quest_desc: ["Put these hammers into an anvil to reforge the tool/armor/weapon in question."]
	quest.58532BC3E157AAC7.quest_desc: ["The shop takes a slight fee with the conversion rate. "]
	quest.58532BC3E157AAC7.title: "Bottle O' Enchanting"
	quest.5947B86CA241FE5E.quest_desc: ["If you want to use Powah!, you can. However, this modpack will focus on the much more unique OriTech."]
	quest.5A4977D0A1D95409.quest_desc: ["It has to be in the path of the particle. "]
	quest.5AB23A9BD3017983.quest_desc: ["Isn't this the perfect machine for your hearth? Just add water!"]
	quest.5C26411A1DE206A6.quest_desc: ["Yo, craft this."]
	quest.5DB8DED325D0AFCD.quest_desc: [
		"Press [R] to access your toolbelt once placed in the corresponding Curio slot."
		"It's useful. Use it. "
	]
	quest.5F4530B4039BCC57.quest_desc: [
		"Craft your own Elytra!"
		"You'll also need a binding."
	]
	quest.60E37C85FB0995A9.quest_desc: [
		"The pinnacle of OriTech! Cybernetically alter your body to gain permanent bonuses. Walk into the machine after construction to access the research tree."
		""
		"In order to research, you must attach the three research stations listed here. "
		"Each research requires materials. Right-click the Cybernetic Augmentation Center to place those materials inside. "
		""
		"Hold [G] to access your augments."
	]
	quest.61D1C2F8718434D1.quest_desc: ["Seriously there's always too many of these things."]
	quest.61ED6EBFB1B73250.quest_desc: ["I hate these things."]
	quest.62D076F3D54999DF.quest_desc: ["In case you're dying of thirst."]
	quest.62F09F9C13E9E5C5.quest_desc: ["This lets you capture the power of a particle collision!"]
	quest.6477D0EC30C3EA84.quest_desc: ["gj frfr"]
	quest.64F8F55D27408749.quest_desc: ["Speeds up the particle. You need to power this block."]
	quest.66F6B2D2CBEFFCBE.quest_desc: ["Please just check the wiki I beg you."]
	quest.6721380D6F1E83A4.quest_desc: [
		"Farmtastic! features Cold Sweat and Thirst was Taken. "
		""
		"You need to insulate yourself against the elements. Goat fur helps against the cold, Rabbit hide against extreme heat, and leather is neutral. Chameleon Molts are adaptable and worth traveling to a jungle or desert to find."
		""
		"A sewing table and any armor is required to create the insulating liner. "
	]
	quest.6721380D6F1E83A4.title: "Getting Started, Temperature"
	quest.674DD08A1C87958B.quest_desc: [
		"Why yes, Catacylsm is present. "
		""
		"If you're unsure on how to progress in Catacylsm, please google. "
		"They have in-depth and fancy graphics."
		""
		"If you want a challenge, try defeating every boss!"
	]
	quest.678B37A3EC433A08.title: "Waystone"
	quest.691EAAC6002DF0AA.quest_desc: ["You can turn it into a quarry, or farmer harvester, or more."]
	quest.69A44CF4BD6E6357.quest_desc: ["Hey this also might be worth something."]
	quest.6A611C85ED0A7D5F.quest_desc: ["These guys are scarwy."]
	quest.6AA4E4B514DADCAA.quest_desc: ["Start your own village(r meat farm)!!!"]
	quest.6C685D34B842E512.quest_desc: ["You have to pipe in water into the sink in this modpack. Just so you know."]
	quest.6DCC4B13AC2A7DC5.quest_desc: [
		"You can use the Alloy Forge to save on materials for Crimson Steel. "
		"And that's probably it. Dude the wiki doesn't say a thing."
	]
	quest.6E050A977DAA459C.quest_desc: ["it take power tf"]
	quest.6EB2E4C2C71EE428.title: "Power (basic)"
	quest.6EF177FA4DBBCBDB.quest_desc: [
		"Pipe water into the steam boiler addon, and fuel the usual generator block it's connected to. So if biomass, convert water and biomass into steam, for example. "
		""
		"Then, pipe that steam from the boiler addon into the red socket of the Steam Engine. The Steam Engine will turn some of the steam back into water, so then pipe that back around to the Steam Boiler. "
		""
		"Then enjoy cheap electricity!"
	]
	quest.6F307FA67AD5CFC6.quest_desc: [
		"It is recommended to use the Storage Controller to ease your storage burdens. "
		"Although inferior to AE2, this block, when right-clicked with a stack, will immediately attempt to place your stack into the corresponding slot in a Sophisiticated Storage block within a 15 block radius. "
		""
		"You have been given two Nether Quartz in the previous reward to build this item at your leisure. "
	]
	quest.6F453C967F682D98.quest_desc: ["You can place blocks or seeds with this. Even on the same frame as the Destroyer block, and at the same time! "]
	quest.71D3DBC547BD605E.quest_desc: [
		"For your laser."
		""
		"IMA FIRING MA LASAR"
	]
	quest.74F61E80118E47B0.title: "Automaton Alternative"
	quest.77E573AEA355B48E.title: "Common Artifact Set"
	quest.781A5DBE43129C7A.quest_desc: ["Why are these in all the looter chests? Edit the loot table? Who do you take me for? You think I know how to do that? "]
	quest.78C2A34CB1E46177.quest_desc: ["Keep in your hotbar or in your designated curio slot to get the exact temperature measure."]
	quest.79339D3B381B63C0.quest_desc: [
		"In case you're dying of heat."
		"Put in an icebox to survive a little longer."
	]
	quest.7A8C0499D7D3D7D6.quest_desc: [
		"Building an enclosure is highly recommended. "
		"And spikes will go a long way to help kill annoying enemies!"
		""
		"Did you know that modular golems are aggro'ed by enemy mobs? "
		"And that the humanoid modular golems can shoot bows and arrows? "
		""
		"Why not build some towers with arrow slits? And spikes at the bottom? "
		"Enemy skeletons are super dangerous, so be mindful of that. "
	]
	quest.7E6E9A06D7D39C45.quest_desc: ["Lets you connect with your storage controller if unconnected."]
	quest.7F510BF67B675CA4.quest_desc: ["This is a Nether ore, just so you know."]
	quest.7FCDED36E6EE858B.quest_desc: ["It is recommended to check the wiki for this."]
	quest.7FF25E9D79F24582.quest_desc: ["This is an automated crafter. However, unlike the new 1.21.1 vanilla crafter, the Assembler will craft some components with less ingredients. "]
